WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
Welcome to MX Terminal.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:07.180
Every African market, one terminal.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:10.770
Johannesburg, Lagos, Nairobi and Cairo, end of day, in one workspace.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:16.950
Sign in with Google, or create an account with your email and a password of at least eight characters.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:21.800
This is the board, priced at the last close, every window on one screen.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.280
Move and resize them, and keep your own layout as a workspace.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:32.340
The tape runs along the top: the index level, then every security and its move on the day.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.795
On the left, the watchlist: every company, each with its logo.

00:00:36.795 --> 00:00:40.870
Click one for its company sheet, down to the chief executive.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:48.970
On the right, the session at a glance: advances and declines, gainers, losers, most active, and the volume traded.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.500
It is keyboard first.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.680
Type a ticker, a panel code, or both.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:58.860
M T N, space, F I N, opens MTN's financials.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:03.930
The heatmap: every sector, sized by weight, coloured by the day's move.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.120
Financials.

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:11.960
Income statement, balance sheet and cash flow, from company filings, with the ratios worked out.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:15.900
News.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.480
Press headlines, the regulator wire, dividends and book closures, one wire per market.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:24.145
The screener filters and exports.

00:01:24.145 --> 00:01:28.450
Beside it: commodities, bonds, foreign exchange, time and sales, and ratings.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:32.283
Practise with paper trading.

00:01:32.283 --> 00:01:35.767
Type BUY, a ticker and a quantity, and it fills at the last close.

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:39.250
Live orders through a licensed broker are in development.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:42.840
Make it yours.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:46.080
The account menu opens settings: colour themes, fonts, your default market and panel.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.320
And invite a friend with your own link.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.730
The full written guide is on the site, under Guide.

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:54.855
MX Terminal.

00:01:54.855 --> 00:01:56.990
Every African market, one terminal.

